5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I’d rather look at the scars than the smiles. Let’s check the history.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Agreed. The ground here has a memory. We need to know what it holds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried about the price tag after the party ends. Let’s check the books.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who actually shows up on a Tuesday morning? I need to know the staffing reality.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I’m concerned about the water. If it floods, the plan fails. Let’s check the drainage.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, the books are good, but the condition of the work is better.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The condition of the works from the earlier programme is key.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, the roll is important, but the spend per hectare tells the real story.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, spend is a number. The roll is the people. I need the people.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, the condition is past. The drainage is present. I need the present.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Fair enough. I’ll look at the condition of the works and the upkeep ledger.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I’ll look at the condition of the works and the regional firms tendering.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I’ll look at the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I’ll look at the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services and the volunteer groups working with the division.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll look at the drainage callouts and August heat readings and the timed counts of weekday crossings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let’s see what the ground remembers.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,Let’s see who can actually dig it.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mio,,Let’s see what it costs to keep it alive.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let’s see who is actually there to keep it alive.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let’s see if the water and the people agree.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
