35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The apron is patched three times. The basin is fine. We build what lasts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,Two firms. Both flag clay. We need shallow work. No deep cuts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, the ledger says planted ground costs triple to keep. The fund won’t pay for paving.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the roll is seven. The volunteers are already here. We don’t need more staff.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, the water is the problem. The people are the proof. We need open ground.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, if the fund won’t pay for paving, we don’t pave. We plant.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, planting is good. But the clay is bad. We need shallow roots.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, seven staff and volunteers? That’s a lot of trust. I need to know the cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the cost is the time. The volunteers are already there. The staff are the backup.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the water is the problem. The people are the proof. We need open ground.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, open ground is good. But the clay is bad. We need drainage.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, drainage is good. But the firms are few. We need to be careful.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, the fund pays for planting. The ledger says it’s expensive. We need to be careful.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the volunteers are the key. The staff are the backup. We need to trust them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the water is the problem. The people are the proof. We need open ground.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let’s build what lasts. No deep cuts. Shallow roots. Good drainage.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,Let’s trust the firms. No deep cuts. Shallow roots. Good drainage.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mio,,Let’s trust the fund. No paving. Planting. Good drainage.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
